Z||000000||sdm1964||03-26-2000||09:06 PM||||Man i just got back and had to tell what a GREAT time i had this weekend. There were over 160 Fiero's from 22 States. I met phill and mrfixit56. Phill has one fine ride!!! Phill won second and i won second in 85 Fiero GT Street. Not bad for the first  first time!!!! I met some real nice folks and put the word out about this fine forum. Thanks to everyone for all the help and Cliff for one nice place talk with other fiero nuts. Pics will follow!!! Wish you all could have been there.||||reg||14
Z||000001||DXR_DAD||03-26-2000||09:18 PM||||Way ta-go 64, love to see a first timmer get his props!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. Can't wait to see the pics. I  talked to mrfixit56 on the land line and he sounds like a real nice guy a true FieroN.<BR>I will make one of these big fiero shows one day, and hope to meet some more of the forum members.<P>Don't forget the pics.||||reg||14
